":"Version 1.3.1","tag":"v1.3.1","published_at":"2026-11-05T21:00:31Z","body":"### Fixes\n- Pace no longer stays running forever when `eventLag: false` is passed to `Pace.start()`, for example after loading pace with a bundler. The event-lag check now keeps the settings it was created with.\n\n### Documentation\n- The README's bundler example now works: set `window.paceOptions` in a module imported before pace (or, with RequireJS, in a script before `require()`), then call `Pace.start()`.\n- The `progress` event is now listed in the README's Events section.\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}